{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3qh43uts","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"Wrong release and corrupt bytes must fail before import. An empty cache must download and succeed.\n\nInitial probe hashed clean source but used driver container commands. Corrected execution loads and invokes the cloned controller. Initial observations remain diagnostic history, not final acceptance evidence.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
