{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p07ypsvq","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"Keep one worker and reuse only checksum-verified tool archives. No private inputs belong in caches.\n\nDo not infer concurrency savings from serial samples. Proposed follow-up: 20 samples per mode, investigate setup over 15 seconds or execution over 5 seconds before adding workers.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
