{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nqtc7mtc","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"PBI-075: measured evidence and decision are available after final verification.\n\nPBI-078 / PLAN: independent operator reproduction with fresh inputs remains required. Same-agent automation cannot establish that condition. No sprint closure or independent acceptance is claimed.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
